      <h2 id="mission-title" class="visually-hidden">Our mission</h2>
      <blockquote class="pullquote pullquote--long">OGE strengthens the School of Social Work's mission by leading, supporting, and coordinating its global engagement initiatives. OGE fosters strategic partnerships both on campus and internationally, cultivates a thriving community of international students and scholars, and supports and creates opportunities for students, faculty, staff, alumni, professionals, and lifelong learners to connect with peers and institutions worldwide.</blockquote>
      <figcaption class="pullquote-cite">Office of Global Engagement, Steve Hicks School of Social Work</figcaption>
