      <p class="eyebrow">Our vision</p>
      <h2 class="mt-0">We envision a peaceful and prosperous world for all.</h2>
      <p>The Office of Global Engagement is a new and growing strategic priority of the Steve Hicks School of Social Work, aligned with the School's 2024–2026 strategic priorities. OGE offers global research, global academic exchange and global practicum education, building on more than three decades of international social work at the School.</p>
      <p>Everything we do begins with the student and the community: we leave to learn, and we return to lead.</p>
